      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale is primarily composed of stable Al- and Cr-containing oxides such as Al2O3 and Cr2O3.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Formation of a dense protective oxide scale reduces oxidation weight gain.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The high-temperature protective oxide scale also impedes aqueous chloride corrosion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protective oxide-scale formation supports retention of load-bearing mechanical strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protective oxide formation enables the alloy to retain low density while achieving strength, corrosion resistance, and oxidation resistance simultaneously.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper segregation in AlCrTiV0.5Cux alloys accelerates localized corrosion in 0.6 M NaCl.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10095625::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microsegregation creates localized electrochemical potential differences that produce galvanic corrosion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10095625::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microsegregation disrupts formation of a continuous high-temperature oxide scale.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microsegregation increases high-temperature oxidation rates.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microsegregation ultimately deteriorates mechanical properties.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "AlCrTiV0.5 is a lightweight alloy with high corrosion resistance in 0.6 M NaCl.",
