      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to an intentionally segregated variant, the homogenized alloy will retain higher tensile strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightweight multicomponent alloys can combine a density of about 5 g/cm3 with tensile yield strength above 1000 MPa and tensile ductility above 20%.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
